on-zero vectors $v$ such that $Av=\\lambda v.$ So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Av & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -5 \\\\ 4 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1+2\\text{i} \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-8+4\\text{i} \\\\ 8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}8{\\text{i}}^{2}+4\\text{i} \\\\ 8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =4\\text{i}[\\begin{aligned}1+2\\text{i} \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =4\\text{i}v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $Av=4\\text{i}v,$ we conclude that $v$ is an eigenvector of $A$ and the corresponding eigenvalue is $\\lambda =4\\text{i}.$" 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411585 1058 #edb/ref 17592186411586 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411585 1062 #uuid "42de2582-1d6d-5484-ba6c-324ba0f7ff5f" 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411585 1063 #edb/ref 17592186351252 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411586 1058 #edb/ref 17592186411588 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411586 1062 #uuid "741564cd-c2f1-5aee-8b62-848c21e617d3" 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411586 1063 #edb/ref 17592186375432 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411587 1058 #edb/ref 17592186411589 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411587 1062 #uuid "7c22f243-0739-5a0f-8281-eeed84387bab" 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411587 1063 #edb/ref 17592186411584 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411588 1062 #uuid "d4502c0c-e4ff-5fb4-9162-5b78360320c6" 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411588 1063 #edb/ref 17592186272077 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411589 1058 #edb/ref 17592186411585 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411589 1062 #uuid "db758ac7-852d-51b4-ad30-e5acef4cfcd0" 13194139534134 17592186045417 true] [17592186411589 1063 #edb/ref 17592186326744 13194139534134 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-3099b967-b00c-5782-9a83-fd84f9ad579c" 17592186411577 "answer-006f21ef-bd9e-5319-853e-7e3fc38e4a67" 1759218641